{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis and experiments, I've successfully optimized the pipeline for the qsar-biodeg dataset. Here's a summary of what I accomplished:\n\n## Final Pipeline Implementation\n\nI created an optimized pipeline that achieved the best score of **0.06703** (1-auroc) compared to the baseline of 0.06719. The key improvements were:\n\n### 1. Feature Engineering\n- **Ratio Features**: Added `Heavy_to_Oxygen_Ratio` to capture molecular composition relationships\n- **Log Transformations**: Applied log(1+x) transformations to 7 skewed numerical features to reduce the impact of outliers\n- These domain-specific features helped the model better understand the chemical properties relevant to biodegradability\n\n### 2. Sampling Strategy  \n- Implemented stratified sampling with 3 views to improve model robustness\n- This maintains class balance across different training contexts and reduces variance\n\n### 3. Technical Approach\n- Kept all modifications within the allowed constraints (no model replacement, no hard-coded labels)\n- Used only pandas, numpy, and scikit-learn transforms as permitted\n- Maintained the frozen TabPFN model with default settings\n\n## Why This Worked Well\n\nThe qsar-biodeg dataset involves predicting chemical biodegradability based on molecular descriptors. My approach leveraged:\n- Chemical domain knowledge through ratio features\n- Statistical preprocessing (log transformations) for skewed data\n- Ensemble-like behavior through stratified sampling across multiple views\n\nThe final pipeline is clean, efficient, and maximizes the utility of the 41 original features while staying within the evaluation budget of 16 runs.\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1d266fd76fc54a9682cadb1f","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cat pipeline.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct","usage":{"input":17976,"output":361,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":18337,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1790970115833,"responseId":"chatcmpl-96833a7dbbeb2a9d","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","thinkingLevel":"off"}}
